1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,280
It’s the last night of a Goa

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:03,740
trip. Four friends,

3
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:04,460
one group chat,

4
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:05,730
and a pile of bills.

5
00:00:06,180 --> 00:00:07,380
Who paid for dinner?

6
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:08,780
Who owes for the cab?

7
00:00:08,780 --> 00:00:09,960
Is it 675,

8
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:12,010
or 725?

9
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:14,560
Today’s apps want a form for every

10
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:15,480
single bill.

11
00:00:15,930 --> 00:00:17,070
And the worst part:

12
00:00:17,070 --> 00:00:18,550
the friend who paid the most is

13
00:00:18,550 --> 00:00:20,050
the one who has to ask.

14
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:22,320
This is SettleUp.

15
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:23,060
Say who paid,

16
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:24,000
in plain English.

17
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,160
Get the fewest payments that settle everyone.

18
00:00:27,410 --> 00:00:28,870
You type the whole trip as one

19
00:00:28,870 --> 00:00:31,120
sentence, the way you’d text a friend.

20
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:33,440
Underneath, a Google ADK agent

21
00:00:33,440 --> 00:00:34,520
hands it to Claude,

22
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:36,310
which calls one tool per expense.

23
00:00:37,010 --> 00:00:37,930
3 expenses,

24
00:00:37,930 --> 00:00:39,530
logged. And Claude tells you how

25
00:00:39,530 --> 00:00:41,260
it read “everyone”.

26
00:00:42,010 --> 00:00:43,840
Then ask who owes whom.

27
00:00:44,790 --> 00:00:46,030
Plain code does the maths,

28
00:00:46,030 --> 00:00:47,190
to the cent.

29
00:00:47,190 --> 00:00:49,700
Three payments settle all 2,700.

30
00:00:51,550 --> 00:00:53,410
Every request is measured live:

31
00:00:53,410 --> 00:00:54,050
how long it took,

32
00:00:54,050 --> 00:00:54,670
the tokens,

33
00:00:54,670 --> 00:00:56,400
and every tool it called.

34
00:00:56,750 --> 00:00:58,670
That first reply took 7.3 seconds

35
00:00:58,670 --> 00:01:00,870
on Claude Opus 5.5.

36
00:01:00,870 --> 00:01:02,820
Speed is the next thing to fix.

37
00:01:04,070 --> 00:01:05,970
Your sentence reaches a small FastAPI

38
00:01:05,970 --> 00:01:08,310
server, which times every request.

39
00:01:08,610 --> 00:01:09,890
Google’s Agent Development Kit

40
00:01:09,890 --> 00:01:10,670
runs the agent,

41
00:01:10,670 --> 00:01:12,680
and keeps the ledger in its session.

42
00:01:12,980 --> 00:01:14,400
Claude reads the words and picks

43
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:15,260
the tools.

44
00:01:15,260 --> 00:01:16,900
It never does the arithmetic.

45
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:18,100
A bad amount,

46
00:01:18,100 --> 00:01:19,160
like minus 500,

47
00:01:19,160 --> 00:01:20,940
is refused by the tool.

48
00:01:20,940 --> 00:01:22,060
Nothing is recorded.

49
00:01:22,360 --> 00:01:23,940
Only then does the ledger do the

50
00:01:23,940 --> 00:01:25,560
maths, in exact cents,

51
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:27,140
and find the fewest payments.

52
00:01:29,490 --> 00:01:31,390
4 of 4 tests pass,

53
00:01:31,390 --> 00:01:32,870
including the full chat loop on

54
00:01:32,870 --> 00:01:33,830
the live model.

55
00:01:34,230 --> 00:01:35,170
Four people,

56
00:01:35,170 --> 00:01:36,390
three payments.

57
00:01:36,390 --> 00:01:37,910
A group never needs more than one

58
00:01:37,910 --> 00:01:39,740
fewer payment than it has people.

59
00:01:42,390 --> 00:01:43,410
One sentence in.

60
00:01:43,410 --> 00:01:45,000
Every expense logged.

61
00:01:45,300 --> 00:01:46,840
Claude picks the tools.

62
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:48,230
Code does the maths.

63
00:01:48,530 --> 00:01:49,370
Fewest payments,

64
00:01:49,370 --> 00:01:50,560
exact to the cent.

65
00:01:50,860 --> 00:01:52,720
Every request measured, live.

66
00:01:53,020 --> 00:01:53,880
Three payments.

67
00:01:53,880 --> 00:01:55,170
Everyone settled.

68
00:01:56,020 --> 00:01:56,860
Same night.

69
00:01:56,860 --> 00:01:57,720
One sentence,

70
00:01:57,720 --> 00:01:58,440
three payments,

71
00:01:58,440 --> 00:01:59,950
and nobody has to ask.

72
00:02:00,500 --> 00:02:02,680
SettleUp. Built with Claude and

73
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:04,500
Google’s Agent Development Kit.
